of harm to children/adults.\n\nTo date, the FCC remains non-compliant with court mandate!  \n\nTo date, the FCC clings to notoriously outdated 1996 'guidelines' aka radiation exposure limits, some of the highest in the world!  \n\nWorth repeating... The FCC is clinging to nearly 30 year old radiation exposure limits (1996) a decade before iPhones were on the market (June 2007)!\n\nHow does this even make any sense??!\n\nWe know that today, there is an exponentially cumulative amount of radiation we are being exposed to from cell towers/antennas, 'smart' utility meters, cellphones, laptops/notebooks, 'smart' appliances, RFID chips, GPS trackers, 'smart' sensors, electronic devices, even completely 'smart' homes compared to 1996.  \n\nThere are already people/pets who are getting so sick from wireless towers/antennas/'smart' utility meters, some are forced to leave their homes, seek refuge in low EMF areas (if any will be left).  \n\nWHY isn't the FCC, NIH, FDA, EPA, CDC held accountable?  \n\nClearly, a proverbial dangerous case of the fox watching the henhouse, saying 'nothing to see here!'\n\nBE INFORMED and SHARE!   Go to:\n \nENVIRONMENTAL HEALTH TRUST\nhttps://t.co/LENa3dTWi2\n\nCHILDREN'S HEALTH DEFENSE https://t.co/PEJrGRkfFH\n\nTHE NATIONAL CALL FOR SAFE TECHNOLOGY  https://t.co/UyPTMapett \n\nPHYSICIANS FOR SAFE TECHNOLOGY \nhttps://t.co/bi938vUvZk \n\nAMERICANS FOR RESPONSIBLE TECHNOLOGY https://t.co/InVwzLmVue \n\nWE ARE NOT SAM \nhttps://t.co/2g81n6je34", 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [{'display_url': 'thehill.com/opinion/techno…', 'expanded_url': 'https://thehill.com/opinion/technology/4437988-why-did-nih-abruptly-halt-research-on-the-harms-of-cell-phone-radiation/', 'url': 'https://t.co/YHRwce8PEy', 'indices': [84, 107]}, {'display_url': 'bioinitiative.org', 'expanded_url': 'https://bioinitiative.org', 'url': 'https://t.co/cgniPcVjuV', 'indices': [819, 842]}, {'display_url': 'ehtrust.org', 'expanded_url': 'http://ehtrust.org', 'u